  "prefLabel": "Bea 305.03 Grant Funds Used or Not Used",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 305.03 Grant Funds Used or Not Used. All organizations shall report to the JPP administrator a final accounting of funds used and any portions of the dollars allocated for their grant that will not be used within 15 days from the completion date of their project.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36",
